Chapter: CpuBuiltinsTest

 THE ASSERTIONS ARE ARCHITECTURAL INVARIANTS, NOT CAPTURED VALUES. A CR3
 or a CPUID brand string would pin this test to one host and one boot, and
 the expected file would churn on a machine that is not this one. What
 does not vary is what long mode REQUIRES: CR0 must have protected mode
 and paging on, CR3 must be page-aligned and non-zero, CPUID leaf 0 must
 answer a maximum leaf of at least one, and the four registers of a leaf
 must not all be the same value.

 THE RBX CHECK IS THE POINT OF THE WHOLE FILE. CPUID clobbers RBX, and
 RBX is callee-saved in this ABI -- the prologue pushes it. If the helper
 failed to restore it, the corruption would appear in whatever the CALLER
 was holding, which is a value computed BEFORE the cpuid and used AFTER
 it. So a live value is carried across every CPUID call below and compared
 to itself at the end. The design's proposed sequence would fail this line
 and pass every other one.

 We say:

Section: Bits

  bit-set : Integer, Integer -> Text
  bit-set (v) (b) = if bit-and v (bit-shl 1 b) /= 0 then "1" else "0"

Section: Body

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let guard = 305419896
    in let cr0 = cpu-read-cr0
    in let cr3 = cpu-read-cr3
    in let maxleaf = cpu-cpuid-eax 0
    in let a1 = cpu-cpuid-eax 1
    in let b1 = cpu-cpuid-ebx 1
    in let c1 = cpu-cpuid-ecx 1
    in let d1 = cpu-cpuid-edx 1
    in act
      print-line-uni ("cr0-pe: " & bit-set cr0 0 & " cr0-pg: " & bit-set cr0 31)
      print-line-uni ("cr3-nonzero: " & show (cr3 /= 0) & " cr3-page-aligned: " & show (bit-and cr3 4095 == 0))
      print-line-uni ("cpuid-maxleaf-at-least-1: " & show (maxleaf >= 1))
      print-line-uni ("leaf1-eax-nonzero: " & show (a1 /= 0))
      print-line-uni ("leaf1-fits-32-bits: " & show (a1 >= 0 & a1 <= 4294967295))
      print-line-uni ("leaf1-edx-fpu: " & bit-set d1 0 & " leaf1-edx-tsc: " & bit-set d1 4)
      print-line-uni ("leaf1-regs-differ: " & show (a1 /= b1 | b1 /= c1 | c1 /= d1))
      print-line-uni ("rbx-preserved: " & show (guard == 305419896))
    end
  end
